    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「もう、だいたい終わっちゃってるかなぁ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「コホ、コホ。息切れしちゃった、これじゃあ現場に駆けつけても足手まといだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「でも、怪我したひとの手当てとかならできるかも……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「がんばろう。強くなるって決めたんだ、この新撰組で」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「うわっ、池田屋が火事になっちゃってる。火鉢が引っくり返りでもしたのかな、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「それとも倒幕派のひとが『どさくさ』で逃げるために自分で火をつけたとか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「すっごい煙……コホ、コホ。大丈夫かなぁ、逃げ遅れたひとがいるかも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「悠木さんとか、たまに突っこみすぎちゃうし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「火消しのひとは、もう到着してるっぽい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「隣近所に類焼することはなさそうだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「火事のたびに建物をいくつも壊しちゃうの『もったいない』気がするなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「できるだけ早く、『こういうこと』が二度と起こらないようにしなくちゃ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「そのための新撰組だもんね、平和な国を目指して努力しよう。わたしも、及ばずながら……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「……あれっ？」"
